{
  "$schema": "hub/facet.semantics@1",
  "summary": "PaymentMaskedNumber отображает номер банковского счёта или карты на desktop и mobile-web. Создавай только публичный PaymentMaskedNumber; Major, Minor, RightAddon и SwapMe являются внутренними частями.",
  "guidance": [
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "publicBoundary",
      "body": {
        "publicRoots": [
          "PaymentMaskedNumber"
        ],
        "internalOnly": [
          "Major",
          "Minor",
          "RightAddon",
          "SwapMe"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "contentPolicy",
      "body": {
        "accountMajorPattern": "5-3-1-4-3",
        "cardMajorPattern": "4-4-4",
        "minorDigits": 4,
        "groupSeparator": "U+205F",
        "maskMajor": "·· ",
        "maskCharacters": [
          "U+00B7",
          "U+00B7",
          "U+2009"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "addonPolicy",
      "body": {
        "defaultVisible": false,
        "placeholder": "SwapMe",
        "placeholderAllowedInFinalDesign": false,
        "allowedSwapComponents": "context-defined",
        "gapPx": 4,
        "maxHeight": "number.lineHeight"
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "typographyPolicy",
      "body": {
        "preserveEffectiveBaselinePair": true,
        "publishedTextStyleRequired": true,
        "rawTypographyAllowed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "overflowPolicy",
      "body": {
        "maxLines": 1,
        "mode": "ellipsis-before-minor",
        "preserveLastDigits": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "statesAndInteraction",
      "body": {
        "ownStates": [],
        "clickability": "context-defined"
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "criticalBaselines",
      "body": [
        "Используй математический пробел U+205F; обычный пробел является error.",
        "При маскировании сохраняй Minor из четырёх последних цифр и Major `·· `.",
        "Major и Minor могут использовать любой общий цветовой токен, но их token binding обязан совпадать.",
        "Major и Minor сохраняют effective-baseline text styles как пару; raw typography является error.",
        "Если Addon показан, замени SwapMe; сохрани gap 4 px и высоту не больше line-height номера.",
        "В узком контейнере сохраняй одну строку, штатный ellipsis и последние четыре цифры Minor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "agentInstructions",
      "body": [
        "Не требуй default-цвет: синхронная смена Major и Minor на другой токен разрешена.",
        "Не разрешай raw-цвет или разные токены у Major и Minor.",
        "Не предлагай вставлять Major, Minor, RightAddon или SwapMe отдельно.",
        "Не ограничивай набор swap-компонентов Addon без отдельного правила сценария; запрещено только оставлять служебный SwapMe.",
        "Не утверждай, что PaymentMaskedNumber или Addon обязательно кликабельны либо обязательно статичны: это определяется контекстом.",
        "Не придумывай собственные loading, disabled или error состояния PaymentMaskedNumber.",
        "Не называй context-only правила Addon geometry и overflow автоматически проверенными текущим Apollo."
      ]
    },
    {
      "area": "usage",
      "topic": "ruleReferences",
      "body": [
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.public-root-only",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.unmasked-major-format",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.mask-format",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.minor-last-four-digits",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.parts-share-color-token",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.addon-uses-final-component",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.addon-geometry",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.typography-follows-effective-pair",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.text-style-binding-required",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.narrow-overflow-preserves-last-four",
        "component:web-corp.payment-masked-number.interaction-and-states-are-contextual"
      ]
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "publicBoundary",
      "body": {
        "publicRoots": [
          "PaymentMaskedNumber"
        ],
        "internalRoots": [
          "Major",
          "Minor",
          "RightAddon",
          "SwapMe"
        ],
        "internalStandaloneAllowed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "usage",
      "body": {
        "purpose": "Отображение номера банковского счёта или номера карты.",
        "platforms": [
          "desktop",
          "mobile-web"
        ],
        "platformSpecificRoots": false
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "numberFormat",
      "body": {
        "account": {
          "majorPattern": "5-3-1-4-3",
          "minorDigits": 4
        },
        "card": {
          "majorPattern": "4-4-4",
          "minorDigits": 4
        },
        "groupSeparator": {
          "character": " ",
          "unicode": "U+205F",
          "ordinarySpaceAllowed": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "masking",
      "body": {
        "property": "Major.Mask Number",
        "enabledValue": "True",
        "majorValue": "·· ",
        "majorCharacters": [
          "U+00B7",
          "U+00B7",
          "U+2009"
        ],
        "preserveLastDigits": 4,
        "sameForAccountAndCard": true
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "visualPolicy",
      "body": {
        "majorAndMinorColor": "Any design-system color token is allowed when both parts use the same token binding.",
        "rawColorAllowed": false,
        "differentPartColorsAllowed": false,
        "effectiveBaselineColorRequired": false
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "addon",
      "body": {
        "defaultVisible": false,
        "swapAllowed": true,
        "allowedSwapComponents": "context-defined",
        "placeholderComponent": "SwapMe",
        "placeholderAllowedInFinalDesign": false,
        "gapPx": 4,
        "maxHeight": "number.lineHeight"
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "typography",
      "body": {
        "policy": "preserve-effective-baseline-pair",
        "layers": [
          "Major",
          "Minor"
        ],
        "publishedTextStyleRequired": true,
        "rawTypographyAllowed": false,
        "independentPartChangeAllowed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "overflow",
      "body": {
        "maxLines": 1,
        "mode": "ellipsis-before-minor",
        "preserveLastDigits": 4,
        "manualShorteningAllowed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "statesAndInteraction",
      "body": {
        "ownStates": [],
        "unsupportedStates": [
          "loading",
          "disabled",
          "error"
        ],
        "clickability": "context-defined",
        "rootMayBeInteractive": true,
        "addonMayBeInteractive": true
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "api",
      "topic": "ruleSource",
      "body": {
        "repository": "core-ds/ds-ai-hub",
        "path": "products/ab/patterns/payment-masked-number.md",
        "status": "owner-approved-full-semantic-draft"
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "composition",
      "topic": "publicRoots",
      "body": [
        "PaymentMaskedNumber"
      ]
    },
    {
      "area": "composition",
      "topic": "internalOnly",
      "body": [
        "Major",
        "Minor",
        "RightAddon",
        "SwapMe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "area": "composition",
      "topic": "ownership",
      "body": {
        "hostOwns": [
          "Major",
          "Minor",
          "Addon visibility",
          "Addon gap",
          "number formatting",
          "typography pair",
          "single-line overflow"
        ],
        "internalStandaloneAllowed": false
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "composition",
      "topic": "slots",
      "body": {
        "Addon": {
          "defaultVisible": false,
          "swapAllowed": true,
          "allowedComponents": "context-defined",
          "placeholder": "SwapMe",
          "placeholderAllowedInFinalDesign": false,
          "gapPx": 4,
          "maxHeight": "number.lineHeight"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "area": "composition",
      "topic": "overflow",
      "body": {
        "maxLines": 1,
        "preserveMinorDigits": 4,
        "mode": "ellipsis-before-minor"
      }
    }
  ]
}
